
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,100;1,200;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800;1,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="subscribeemail.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/payment.css" />
    <script src="website2.js"></script>
    <script src="subscribeemail.js"></script>
    <title><%=title %></title>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="searchbar">
                    <img src="/images/websitelogo.png" alt="logo" class="logo">
                    <div>
                       <a href="#" class="smalllogo"><img src="/images/England.png" alt="Country"  class="smallicon" ></a>
                       <a href="#" class="smalllogo"><img src="/images/Help.png" alt="Help" class="smallicon" ></a>
                       <a href="#" class="smalllogo"><img src="/images/Photo.svg" alt="User Account"  class="smallicon"></a> 
        </div>
    </div>
    </header>
    <br>
        <div class="cards" style="display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:3.75em;">
            <div class="left">
                <span class="poppins-bold" style="font-size: 1.5em;line-height: 2.05em;">Information You Need To Pay Attention:</span><br><br>
                <span class="poppins-regular"style="font-size: 1.150em;line-height: 1.625em;">Passengers are divided according to age categories.</span><br>
                <span class="poppins-regular"style="font-size: 0.871em;line-height: 1.321em;">Please check categories</span><br><br>
                <img src="/images/Ticket Photo.svg" alt="Ticket Photo" style="max-width: 100%;max-height: 100%;"><br><br>
                <span class="poppins-bold"style="font-size: 1.5em;line-height: 2.05em;">Your Trip Summary:</span><br><br>
                <span class="poppins-regular" style="font-size:0.871em;line-height: 1.321em;">Your flight take off from ARN Gate 23A , you Enter through C Entrance. </span><br>
                <span class="poppins-regular"style="font-size:0.871em;line-height: 1.321em;">In FCO Airport in Rome You will stay 3h &45m then Exit through Gate D14 .</span><br>
                <span class="poppins-regular"style="font-size:0.871em;line-height: 1.321em;">Final Destination will be SABIHA Airport and You can Exit Through L Door .</span><br><br>
                <img src="/images/Down Text.svg"  alt="textdown">
            </div>
            <div class="right">
                <span class="poppins-bold" style="font-size: 1.5em;line-height: 2.05em;">Payment Methods and Information:</span><br><br>
                <span class="poppins-bold" style="font-size: 1.25em;line-height: 1.75em;">Price Details</span><br><br>
                <img src="/images/P1.svg" class="p1" alt="p1">
                <div class="paymentbox" style="justify-content: space-evenly;">
                   <img src="/images/P2.svg" alt="p2">
            </div><br><br>
            <span class="paymentoptions">
                <span >
                    <span><label style="font-size:1em;line-height: 1.4em;" class="poppins-bold" >Booking for work:</label></span>
                    <span><input type="radio" class="radio" style="min-width: 1.5vw;min-height: 3.2vh;" aria-label="Booking for work"></span>
                </span>  
                <span>
                    <label class="poppins-bold" style="font-size:1em;line-height: 1.4em;" aria-label="Payment box" >Payment Method:</label> <select class="selectbox"style="width: 6vw;height:6.5vh;"><img src="/images/Paypal.svg" alt="Paypal" style="width:2.6vw"></select>
                    </span>
                </span> <br><br>
                    <div style="max-width:33.6vw;max-height:auto;">
                    <form>
                    <div class="formcontainer">
                        <span style="justify-self: left;">
                            <label style="font-size: 0.871em;line-height: 1.225em;"class="poppins-medium" >First Name</label><br>
                            <input type="text"aria-label="Firstname" required style=" height: 6.5vh;min-width:8.7vw;border-radius: 0.125em;border-color: 0.187em solid #a6a6a6;" >
                        </span>
                        <span>
                            <label style="font-size: 0.871em;line-height: 1.225em;"class="poppins-medium" > Last Name</label><br>
                            <input type="text" aria-label="lastname"  style=" height: 6.5vh;min-width:8.7vw;border-radius: 0.125em;border-color: 0.187em solid #a6a6a6;">
                        </span>
                        <span>
                            <label style="font-size: 0.871em;line-height: 1.225em;"class="poppins-medium" > Phone no</label><br>
                            <input type="text" aria-label="phoneno" required style=" height: 6.5vh;min-width:11.7vw;border-radius: 0.125em;border-color: 0.187em solid #a6a6a6;" >
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <br>
                    <div class="formcontainer">
                    <span>
                    <label for="card no"class="poppins-medium"style="font-size: 0.871em;line-height: 1.225em;">Card No:</label><br>
                    <input type="card" id="card no" name="Card No" placeholder="...." required style="height: 6.5vh;min-width:13.8vw;border-radius: 0.187em;border-color: 0.187em solid #a6a6a6;" >
                    </span>
                    <span>
                        <label for="cvc"class="poppins-medium"style="font-size: 0.871em;line-height: 1.225em;">CVC:</label><br>
                        <input type="cvc" id="cvc" name="cvc" placeholder="...." required style="height: 6.5vh;min-width:6.5vw;border-radius: 0.187em;border-color: 0.187em solid #a6a6a6;" >
                        </span>
                    <span>
                    <label for="expdate" class="poppins-medium"style="font-size: 0.871em;line-height: 1.225em;">Exp Date:</label><br>
                    <input type="exp" id="expdate" name="expdate" placeholder="MM/YY" required style=" height: 6.5vh;min-width:6.5vw;border-radius: 0.187em;border-color: 0.187em solid #a6a6a6;" >
                    </span>
            </div>
                </div><br><br>
                <span class="poppins-bold" style="font-size: 1.5em;line-height: 2.05em;">Cancellation Policy</span><br><br>
                <div class="paymentoptions">
                    <div class="poppins-regular" style="font-size: 1em;line-height: 1.5em;">Get a Full refund if you cancel by 23 June (PDT).</div>
                    <div style="font-size: small;font-size: 0.87em;line-height: 1.25em">Read More...</div>
                </div><br>
                <div class="formcontainer2">
                    <div>
                        <button class="Shortcutbutton poppins-bold" style="min-width: 17.7vw;height:6.5vh;border-radius:0.25em;border-color:0.187em solid #07689f;padding: 0.5em 1em 0.5em 1em; gap:1em;color: #07689F;" aria-label="Confirm and Pay">Confirm and Pay</button>
                        <div class="contentgray" style="font-size: 0.5em; justify-content: center;" class="poppins-bold">Check your information before submitting.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                    <input type="submit" class="payment poppins-bold" value="Save If You Like It" id="payment" style="min-width: 17.7vw;height:6.5vh;border-radius:0.25em;border-color:0.187em solid #07689f;padding: 0.5em 1em 0.5em 1em; gap:1em;background-color: #07689F;color:#ffffff" aria-label="Save Favourite">
                    <div class="contentgray" style="font-size: 0.5em; justify-content: center;" class="poppins-light">Save your flight info,find it through Shortcut.</div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
        </div>
        </div><br>
        
        <footer>
                <div style="max-width:100%;max-height:fit-content;">
                <div class="footer">
                <div>
                    <img src="/images/Payment methods.svg" alt="payment methods" style="width:26.4vw;height:6vh;">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <img src="/images/Social Networks.svg" alt="social media"style="width:14vw;height:3vh;">
                </div>
            <div class="formcontainer">
                <div>
            </div>
                <div>
                    <input type="Email" placeholder="Email" style="border-radius: 0.625em;width:20vw;height:6.5vh;">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <input type="submit" value="Subscribe" style="background-color: #07689F;color:#efefef;margin-left: 0.625em;width:6vw;height:6.5vh;">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>
        <div style="max-width:100%;max-height:fit-content;">
            <div class="greyfooter poppins-regular">
                <img src="/images/Under the footer title.svg" alt="footer" style="width:93vw;height:8vh;">
            </div>
        </footer>
        </div>
        </body>
        </html>